# Copy to .env.local (local dev) or add in your host's dashboard (e.g. Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables).
# Both are optional. Without them the site still works: "Ask me" uses canned answers and the live visitor count stays hidden.

# Real answers for "Ask me" on /about, from Claude grounded in the site's own content.
# Create a key at https://platform.claude.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Live "N people here right now" in the top bar, via Ably presence (free tier is plenty).
# Create an app at https://ably.com and copy its root API key.
ABLY_API_KEY=
